{"note": "Dáithí's GCSE verb booklet (Ardscoil Naomh Pól, GCSE: Using Verbs), updated for 2026 and the app's rulings: muid first for we in the present and future, both forms for we and they in the conditional, cluin not clois, Ulster forms beside the standard. The booklet's slips are corrected (see data/verb-booklet/REPORT.md). Style rules: GRAMMAR-STYLE.md.", "mnemonics": [{"id": "seimhiu", "title": "Séimhiú (aspirate)", "what": "Put h after the first letter. It changes the spelling and the sound.", "letters": "b c d f g m p s t", "rhyme": "Britney caught dopey friends going mad publicly, silly twits."}, {"id": "no-h-1", "title": "No séimhiú: vowels", "what": "A word beginning with a vowel never takes h.", "letters": "a e i o u á é í ó ú", "rhyme": ""}, {"id": "no-h-2", "title": "No séimhiú: h, l, n, r", "what": "Words beginning with h, l, n or r never take h.", "letters": "h l n r", "rhyme": "He likes noodles and rice."}, {"id": "no-h-3", "title": "No séimhiú: sc, sm, sp, st", "what": "Words beginning with sc, sm, sp or st never take h.", "letters": "sc sm sp st", "rhyme": "Scallions smell spicy in stew."}, {"id": "uru", "title": "Urú (eclipse)", "what": "Put a new letter in front. Only b, c, d, f, g, p and t can be eclipsed.", "letters": "mb gc nd bhf ng bp dt", "rhyme": "Many boys go camping near ditches behind fences, while nice girls buy pens down town.", "examples": ["An [m]buailfidh muid le chéile ag an chaife?", "An [g]ceolfaidh tú amhrán eile?", "i [n]Dún Dealgan", "An [bh]fágann tú do mhála ar scoil achan lá?", "i [n]Gaillimh", "An [b]pósfaidh tú mé?", "An [d]tiocfaidh tú chuig an dioscó liom?"]}], "boxes": [{"id": "c1-broad", "title": "1st conjugation, broad", "ga": "An chéad réimniú, leathan", "colour": "#FDC99A", "verbs": [["fág", "leave"], ["tóg", "lift, take"], ["las", "light"], ["leag", "knock down"], ["ól", "drink"], ["scuab", "brush"], ["amharc", "watch, look"], ["scríobh", "write"], ["alp", "devour"], ["fan", "wait, stay"], ["díol", "sell"], ["gearr", "cut"], ["glan", "clean"], ["snámh", "swim"], ["bíog", "twitch"], ["claon", "incline"], ["cleacht", "practise"], ["dreap", "climb"], ["éag", "die"], ["gléas", "dress"], ["iarr", "ask for"], ["pléasc", "explode"]]}, {"id": "c1-slender", "title": "1st conjugation, slender", "ga": "An chéad réimniú, caol", "colour": "#FFFF99", "verbs": [["bris", "break"], ["cuir", "put"], ["éist", "listen"], ["druid", "close"], ["léigh", "read"], ["rith", "run"], ["tit", "fall"], ["bain", "win, cut"], ["léim", "jump"], ["scairt", "shout"], ["caill", "lose"], ["caith", "throw, wear, spend"], ["seinn", "play music"], ["scoilt", "split"], ["tuig", "understand"], ["buail", "hit, meet"], ["géill", "give in"], ["mair", "live, last"], ["scaip", "spread"]]}, {"id": "c2-broad", "title": "2nd conjugation, broad", "ga": "An dara réimniú, leathan", "colour": "#CCFFCC", "verbs": [["ceannaigh", "buy"], ["maraigh", "kill"], ["folmhaigh", "empty"], ["éalaigh", "escape"], ["greamaigh", "stick"], ["admhaigh", "admit"], ["cruthaigh", "prove, create"], ["neartaigh", "strengthen"], ["cláraigh", "register"], ["clúdaigh", "cover"], ["eagraigh", "organise"], ["feabhsaigh", "improve"], ["fiafraigh (de)", "ask"], ["folaigh", "hide"], ["méadaigh", "increase"], ["ordaigh", "order"], ["roghnaigh", "choose"], ["beannaigh", "bless, greet"], ["tiontaigh", "turn"], ["ullmhaigh", "prepare"]]}, {"id": "c2-slender", "title": "2nd conjugation, slender", "ga": "An dara réimniú, caol", "colour": "#99CCFF", "verbs": [["aimsigh", "find"], ["cruinnigh", "gather"], ["cóirigh", "fix, arrange"], ["cuidigh (le)", "help"], ["ainmnigh", "name"], ["aistrigh", "translate"], ["cuimhnigh", "remember"], ["tuairiscigh", "report"], ["cinntigh", "make sure"], ["deifrigh", "hurry"], ["fáiltigh", "welcome"], ["litrigh", "spell"], ["oibrigh", "work"], ["deisigh", "mend"], ["bailigh", "collect"], ["imigh", "leave, go away"]]}, {"id": "sync", "title": "Syncopated verbs", "ga": "Briathra coimrithe", "colour": "#CC99FF", "verbs": [["oscail", "open"], ["inis", "tell"], ["imir", "play"], ["aithin", "recognise"], ["eascair", "sprout"], ["cogair", "whisper"], ["múscail", "waken"], ["iompair", "carry"], ["codail", "sleep"], ["labhair", "speak"], ["freagair", "answer"], ["ceangail", "tie"]]}, {"id": "irreg", "title": "Irregular verbs", "ga": "Briathra neamhrialta", "colour": "#FF99CC", "verbs": [["beir", "catch"], ["ith", "eat"], ["tar", "come"], ["cluin", "hear"], ["tabhair", "give, bring"], ["faigh", "get"], ["abair", "say"], ["déan", "do, make"], ["téigh", "go"], ["feic", "see"], ["bí", "be"]]}], "grid": {"tenses": [{"id": "past", "ga": "An Aimsir Chaite", "en": "Past", "colour": "#FFFF99"}, {"id": "present", "ga": "An Aimsir Láithreach", "en": "Present", "colour": "#99CCFF"}, {"id": "future", "ga": "An Aimsir Fháistineach", "en": "Future", "colour": "#FF99CC"}, {"id": "conditional", "ga": "An Modh Coinníollach", "en": "Conditional", "colour": "#CC99FF"}], "rows": [{"id": "pos-cons", "label": "Positive: a verb that can take h", "cells": {"past": ["Séimhiú.", "Add the pronoun: c[h]uir mé, b[h]ris sí."], "present-1": ["Broad: add -aim (mé) or -ann (everyone else).", "Slender: add -im or -eann.", "We: -ann muid or -aimid."], "present-2": ["Remove -aigh or -igh.", "Broad: add -aím or -aíonn. Slender: add -ím or -íonn.", "We: -aíonn muid or -aímid."], "future-1": ["Broad: add -faidh. Slender: add -fidh.", "We: -faidh muid or -faimid."], "future-2": ["Remove -aigh or -igh.", "Broad: add -óidh. Slender: add -eoidh.", "We: -óidh muid or -óimid."], "conditional-1": ["Séimhiú.", "Broad: add -fainn (mé), -fadh (everyone else). Slender: -finn, -feadh.", "We: -faimis or -fadh muid. They: -faidís or -fadh siad."], "conditional-2": ["Remove -aigh or -igh, then séimhiú.", "Broad: add -óinn, -ódh. Slender: -eoinn, -eodh.", "We: -óimis or -ódh muid. They: -óidís or -ódh siad."]}}, {"id": "pos-vowel", "label": "Positive: a verb that starts with a vowel", "cells": {"past": ["Put d' in front.", "Add the pronoun: d'ól mé, d'éist sé."], "present-1": ["No change at the front: ólaim, éisteann sé."], "present-2": ["No change at the front: ullmhaím, oibríonn sé."], "future-1": ["No change at the front: ólfaidh mé."], "future-2": ["No change at the front: ullmhóidh sé."], "conditional-1": ["Put d' in front: d'ólfainn, d'éistfeadh sé."], "conditional-2": ["Put d' in front: d'ullmhóinn, d'oibreodh sé."]}}, {"id": "pos-f", "label": "Positive: a verb that starts with f", "cells": {"past": ["Put d' in front.", "Séimhiú on the f.", "Add the pronoun: d'f[h]ág mé."], "present-1": ["No change at the front: fágaim."], "present-2": ["No change at the front: fiafraím."], "future-1": ["No change at the front: fágfaidh mé."], "future-2": ["No change at the front: fiafróidh sé."], "conditional-1": ["Put d' in front and séimhiú on the f: d'f[h]ágfainn."], "conditional-2": ["Put d' in front and séimhiú on the f: d'f[h]iafróinn."]}}, {"id": "neg", "label": "Negative", "cells": {"past": ["{Níor} and séimhiú where you can.", "No d': {Níor} f[h]ág mé, {Níor} ól mé."], "all": ["{Ní} and séimhiú.", "Take away d': {Ní} f[h]ágfainn, {Ní} ólann sé."]}}, {"id": "q", "label": "Question", "cells": {"past": ["{Ar} and séimhiú where you can.", "No d': {Ar} f[h]ág tú? {Ar} ól tú?"], "all": ["{An} and urú.", "Take away d': {An} [bh]fágann tú? {An} ólann tú? (a vowel takes no urú after An)"]}}, {"id": "saor", "label": "Autonomous (nobody named)", "cells": {"past": ["No séimhiú.", "Broad: add -adh. Slender: add -eadh: fágadh, briseadh; ceannaíodh, bailíodh (2nd)."], "present-1": ["Broad: add -tar. Slender: add -tear: fágtar, cuirtear."], "present-2": ["Remove -aigh or -igh. Broad: add -aítear. Slender: add -ítear: ceannaítear, bailítear."], "future-1": ["Broad: add -far. Slender: add -fear: fágfar, cuirfear."], "future-2": ["Remove -aigh or -igh. Broad: add -ófar. Slender: add -eofar: ceannófar, baileofar."], "conditional-1": ["Séimhiú. Broad: add -faí. Slender: add -fí: f[h]ágfaí, c[h]uirfí."], "conditional-2": ["Remove -aigh or -igh, séimhiú. Broad: add -ófaí. Slender: add -eofaí: c[h]eannófaí."]}}]}, "syncopated": {"rule": ["The verb ends in -il, -ir, -is or -in (oscail, imir, inis, aithin).", "In the present, the future and the conditional it loses the vowel of its last syllable: oscail becomes oscl-, imir becomes imr-.", "Then it takes 2nd conjugation endings, broad or slender: osclaím, imreoidh."], "table": [{"verb": "oscail", "past": "d'oscail mé", "present": "osclaím", "future": "osclóidh mé", "conditional": "d'osclóinn"}, {"verb": "imir", "past": "d'imir mé", "present": "imrím", "future": "imreoidh mé", "conditional": "d'imreoinn"}, {"verb": "inis", "past": "d'inis mé", "present": "insím", "future": "inseoidh mé", "conditional": "d'inseoinn"}, {"verb": "aithin", "past": "d'aithin mé", "present": "aithním", "future": "aithneoidh mé", "conditional": "d'aithneoinn"}, {"verb": "eascair", "past": "d'eascair mé", "present": "eascraím", "future": "eascróidh mé", "conditional": "d'eascróinn"}, {"verb": "múscail", "past": "mhúscail mé", "present": "músclaím", "future": "músclóidh mé", "conditional": "mhúsclóinn"}, {"verb": "iompair", "past": "d'iompair mé", "present": "iompraím", "future": "iompróidh mé", "conditional": "d'iompróinn"}]}, "irregular": [{"n": 1, "verb": "beir", "en": "catch", "colour": "#FFC000", "past": {"P": "Rug mé", "N": "Níor rug mé", "Q": "Ar rug tú?", "saor": "Rugadh"}, "present": {"P": "Beirim / Beireann sé / Beireann muid (Beirimid)", "N": "Ní bheirim / Ní bheireann sé", "Q": "An mbeireann tú?", "saor": "Beirtear"}, "future": {"P": "Béarfaidh mé / Béarfaidh muid (Béarfaimid)", "N": "Ní bhéarfaidh mé", "Q": "An mbéarfaidh tú?", "saor": "Béarfar"}, "conditional": {"P": "Bhéarfainn / Bhéarfadh sé / Bhéarfaimis (Bhéarfadh muid)", "N": "Ní bhéarfainn", "Q": "An mbéarfá?", "saor": "Bhéarfaí"}}, {"n": 2, "verb": "ith", "en": "eat", "colour": "#FFFF00", "past": {"P": "D'ith mé", "N": "Níor ith mé", "Q": "Ar ith tú?", "saor": "Itheadh"}, "present": {"P": "Ithim / Itheann sé